{"assets":["/statement-assets/c823257ef8e3b14668ce5316b661e3ea2235c6e9cb73dee1f41db53bf68829f4.png","/statement-assets/9e902f1e381b622374bbe3d0d1c9076765a795ed4ae988f60c6b1432e7cd78ed.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2148","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Gravity Falls"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Farmer John has $$$n$$$ arrays $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ that may have different lengths. He will stack the arrays on top of each other, resulting in a grid with $$$n$$$ rows. The arrays are left-aligned and can be stacked in any order he desires."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then, gravity will take place. Any cell that is not on the bottom row and does not have an element beneath it will fall down a row. This process will be repeated until there are no cells that satisfy the aforementioned constraint."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Over all possible ways FJ can stack the arrays, output the lexicographically minimum bottom row after gravity takes place."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 1000$$$)  — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the following $$$n$$$ lines, the first integer $$$k_i$$$ ($$$1 \\leq k \\leq 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) denotes the length of $$$a_i$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then, $$$k_i$$$ space-separated integers $$$a_{i_1}, a_{i_2}, \\ldots, a_{i_{k_i}}$$$ follow ($$$1 \\leq a_{i_j} \\leq 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ and the sum of all $$$k_i$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output the lexicographically minimum bottom row on a new line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n1\n3 5 2 7\n2\n2 2 9\n3 3 1 4\n3\n1 5\n2 5 1\n2 5 2\n3\n3 4 4 9\n7 7 6 5 4 3 2 1\n4 2 4 5 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 2 7 \n2 9 4 \n5 1 \n2 4 5 1 3 2 1 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Demonstration for test case 2: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c823257ef8e3b14668ce5316b661e3ea2235c6e9cb73dee1f41db53bf68829f4.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Demonstration for test case 4:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/9e902f1e381b622374bbe3d0d1c9076765a795ed4ae988f60c6b1432e7cd78ed.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"2148F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2148/problem/F"}